{"id": "34590", "title": "海鸥飞处", "author": "琼瑶", "category": "文学名著", "count": 20, "available": 12, "cover": "files/article/image/34/34590/34590s.jpg", "status": "已完成", "source": "files/article/info/34/34590.htm", "intro": "从香港到台湾的她扮演各种全然不同的角色，也不断捉弄著俞慕槐的感情。海鸥是个杀了丈夫的女人；叶馨是个二流的驻唱歌女；只有杨羽裳是她——一个从小被宠坏、爱恶作剧的富家女。这次，她选错了游戏对象，她不能克制她爱上了俞慕槐，却因不断的误会与猜测，使他们陷入痛苦的爱恨矛盾之中。而欧世澈的出现，将带来什麽样戏剧性的变化？羽裳和慕槐能有缘双飞，抑或将如海鸥般地孤独单飞呢？……", "base": "files/article/html/34/34590", "chapters": [{"title": "第1节", "file": "2198785.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第2节", "file": "2198786.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第3节", "file": "2198787.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第4节", "file": "2198788.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第5节", "file": "2198789.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第6节", "file": "2198790.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第7节", "file": "2198791.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第8节", "file": "2198792.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第9节", "file": "2198793.html", "available": true}, {"title": "第10节", "file": "2198794.html", "available": true}, {"title": "第11节", "file": "2198795.html", "available": true}, {"title": "第12节", "file": "2198796.html", "available": true}, {"title": "第13节", "file": "2198797.html", "available": true}, {"title": "第14节", "file": "2198798.html", "available": true}, {"title": "第15节", "file": "2198799.html", "available": true}, {"title": "第16节", "file": "2198800.html", "available": true}, {"title": "第17节", "file": "2198801.html", "available": true}, {"title": "第18节", "file": "2198802.html", "available": true}, {"title": "第19节", "file": "2198803.html", "available": true}, {"title": "第20节", "file": "2198804.html", "available": true}]}